    <selectionEntry id="94bf-2e73-11ba-ffcd" name="[H][GC][E] - Archaón, ungido del caos, señor del fin de los tiempos" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <modifiers>
        <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="true">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="roster" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="e01b-aa63-8a17-da7d" type="equalTo"/>
          </conditions>
        </modifier>
        <modifier type="set" field="75a8-497b-f44b-0508" value="1">
          <conditions>
            <condition field="selections" scope="roster" value="1.0" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true" includeChildForces="false" childId="1484-43ef-3519-d4dc" type="equalTo"/>
